OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as violence almost doubles
OL,4,Aat prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FRates of violence at a prison in
OL,7,FRutland have almost doubled in three
OL,8,Fyears, a watchdog has found.
OL,10,FHM Inspectorate of Prisons carried out
OL,11,Fan unannounced inspection of HMP
OL,12,FStocken in July and said stated rates
OL,13,Fof violence in the 12 months prior to
OL,14,Fthe visit were 199 per 1,000 prisoners
OL,15,Fcompared to 105 in the year before its
OL,16,Flast inspection in 2023.
OL,18,FThe report also said drug smuggling had
OL,19,Fbecome a "significant threat" to the
OL,20,Fstability of the prison.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
