OL,3,GNEWSAConcern as violence almost doubles
OL,4,Aat prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Ministry of Justice spokesperson said
OL,7,Fit was "urgently" conducting a review
OL,8,Fto shut down routes for illegal
OL,9,Fcontraband and was investing in
OL,10,Fsecurity to tackle violence.
